{"id":"niederlage","lemma":"Niederlage","pos":"noun","rank":3876,"glosses":["defeat, loss"],"ipa":"/ˈniːdɐˌlaːɡə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/04/De-at-Niederlage.ogg/De-at-Niederlage.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Niederlage","plural":"Niederlagen"},"examples":[{"text":"Er gab seine Niederlage zu.","en":"He admitted his defeat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755522","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"to / too"}]},{"text":"Die Niederlage war kaum zu ertragen.","en":"The defeat was hard to accept.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"barely, hardly"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to bear"}]},{"text":"Es war eine schmerzliche Niederlage.","en":"It was a painful defeat.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"painful, cruel","l":"schmerzlich"},null]},{"text":"Was wird eine Niederlage im Krieg für uns bedeuten?","en":"What will losing the war mean to us?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in the"},{"g":"war, warfare"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"to imply"}]},{"text":"Die Niederlage verletzte ihren Stolz.","en":"Losing injured their pride.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"injured , casualty","l":"Verletzter"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"proud"}]}]}